  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into small chunks. Cut zucchini and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, slice haloumi into 1cm-slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64473a3a45a57eb3bb0122c9/step-d563f174.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, combine the water and vegetable stock powder.\n• Bring to the boil, then add couscous. Stir to combine, then cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff couscous up with a fork. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64473a3a45a57eb3bb0122c9/step-759b5fb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a small bowl, mix the honey, sesame seeds (see ingredients), Italian herbs (see ingredients) and a splash of water.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove frying pan from heat. Add the honey mixture, turning haloumi to coat. Set aside.\n• To the couscous pan, add roasted veggies, spinach, rocket & fennel mix, green dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Gently toss to coat. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64473a3a45a57eb3bb0122c9/step-bdb1e75f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roasted veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with honey-sesame herbed haloumi, spooning over any extra glaze from the pan.\n• Serve with a dollop of mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64473a3a45a57eb3bb0122c9/step-d27d8ec2.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
